WEBVTT

1
00:00:02.460 --> 00:00:13.908
More angry dolls piled onto Roxy and Terrell.

2
00:00:15.469 --> 00:00:17.291
Chuckles giggled.

3
00:00:17.311 --> 00:00:19.372
"Good-bye, Rocket Girl!"

4
00:00:20.013 --> 00:00:21.694
"You won't get away!"

5
00:00:22.154 --> 00:00:22.895
Roxy shouted.

6
00:00:22.915 --> 00:00:25.677
"Yes, I will," Chuckles said.

7
00:00:25.697 --> 00:00:27.418
"I got away from Chuck.

8
00:00:28.098 --> 00:00:30.000
He didn't make much money, so I left.

9
00:00:30.696 --> 00:00:34.997
Now I'll create a huge doll army and steal money, money, money!"

10
00:00:35.918 --> 00:00:37.178
Chuckles ran out of the store.

11
00:00:37.198 --> 00:00:42.099
"Grr!" Roxy pushed away some of the dolls.

12
00:00:42.699 --> 00:00:44.360
Other dolls jumped onto her and Terrell.

13
00:00:45.800 --> 00:00:47.681
"Rocket Girl, do something!"

14
00:00:48.101 --> 00:00:48.681
Terrell said.

15
00:00:48.701 --> 00:00:53.002
"I have an idea," Roxy stared at the dolls on top of her.

16
00:00:54.043 --> 00:00:55.923
Orange beams radiated from her eyes.

17
00:00:57.064 --> 00:00:58.304
The dolls began to melt.

18
00:00:59.152 --> 00:01:01.574
Soon a puddle of melted plastic covered the floor.

19
00:01:05.576 --> 00:01:06.196
Terrell said.

20
00:01:07.417 --> 00:01:08.538
Jack and Mara ran over.

21
00:01:08.558 --> 00:01:10.659
"Rocket Girl!"

22
00:01:10.919 --> 00:01:11.459
Mara said.

23
00:01:11.479 --> 00:01:13.221
"I have to go!"

24
00:01:13.541 --> 00:01:14.181
Roxy said.

25
00:01:16.142 --> 00:01:19.724
Zoom! Roxy saw Chuckles a few blocks away.

26
00:01:22.306 --> 00:01:25.228
He opened a taxi door, pulled out the driver, and jumped in.

27
00:01:27.960 --> 00:01:30.102
Tires spun as the taxi raced away.

28
00:01:30.942 --> 00:01:32.203
The driver shook his fist.

29
00:01:32.804 --> 00:01:34.045
"Rotten doll!"

30
00:01:34.866 --> 00:01:36.587
The taxi swerved onto the sidewalk.

31
00:01:39.829 --> 00:01:41.751
"Ahh!" A man jumped out of the way.

32
00:01:43.272 --> 00:01:45.594
Bam! Chuckles drove through a fruit stand.

33
00:01:45.614 --> 00:01:50.138
"This is fun, fun, fun!"

34
00:01:51.058 --> 00:01:52.940
Roxy stopped the taxi and grabbed Chuckles.

35
00:01:56.736 --> 00:01:57.577
The doll bit her.

36
00:01:57.597 --> 00:02:01.040
"Ouch!" Roxy pulled her hand away.

37
00:02:01.060 --> 00:02:03.262
"Chomp, chomp, chomp!"

38
00:02:03.762 --> 00:02:04.663
Chuckles ran away.

39
00:02:05.544 --> 00:02:09.347
Whiz-hoo! Roxy's eye laser beams hit Chuckles' wooden leg.

40
00:02:09.907 --> 00:02:11.128
The leg started to smoke.

41
00:02:12.169 --> 00:02:12.950
Chuckles gulped.

42
00:02:12.970 --> 00:02:15.732
"This is bad, bad, bad!"

43
00:02:17.314 --> 00:02:18.495
A woman had a water bottle.

44
00:02:19.355 --> 00:02:21.737
Chuckles grabbed the bottle and poured the water on his leg.

45
00:02:21.757 --> 00:02:23.779
"Much better!"

46
00:02:24.199 --> 00:02:24.640
he said.

47
00:02:25.436 --> 00:02:27.117
Roxy hurried over and grabbed Chuckles.

48
00:02:27.137 --> 00:02:29.098
"Let me go!"

49
00:02:29.799 --> 00:02:31.800
The doll kicked as Roxy flipped him over.

50
00:02:32.680 --> 00:02:34.441
She found the computer chip and ripped it out.

51
00:02:37.503 --> 00:02:38.543
Chuckles stopped moving.

52
00:02:40.284 --> 00:02:41.445
Roxy wiped her brow.

53
00:02:41.465 --> 00:02:46.327
"Whew!" The valuable dolls weren't alive anymore.

54
00:02:47.268 --> 00:02:49.149
Roxy brought them back to the convention center.

55
00:02:49.889 --> 00:02:51.490
The man in the green suit smiled.

56
00:02:51.510 --> 00:02:53.911
"You're my hero, Rocket Girl!"

57
00:02:56.264 --> 00:02:58.045
Next Roxy brought Chuckles to Chuck.

58
00:02:58.065 --> 00:03:02.346
"I took out the chip," Roxy said.

59
00:03:02.366 --> 00:03:04.906
"Thanks, Rocket Girl," Chuck said.

60
00:03:05.567 --> 00:03:07.007
He pretended Chuckles was talking.

61
00:03:07.627 --> 00:03:09.068
"You're super, Rocket Girl!"

62
00:03:09.088 --> 00:03:12.508
"Um," Roxy said, "your lips are moving."

63
00:03:14.549 --> 00:03:16.530
At Downtown Toys, Roxy found her friends.

64
00:03:16.550 --> 00:03:18.390
"You missed it, Roxy!"

65
00:03:18.650 --> 00:03:19.190
Jack said.

66
00:03:19.210 --> 00:03:21.111
"There was an evil doll!"

67
00:03:21.891 --> 00:03:22.631
Terrell grinned.

68
00:03:22.651 --> 00:03:25.232
"But Rocket Girl stopped it."

69
00:03:26.476 --> 00:03:28.739
"Wow." Roxy turned to Mara.

70
00:03:28.759 --> 00:03:30.841
"Did you pick a gift for Dina yet?"

71
00:03:31.441 --> 00:03:32.863
"Nope," Mara said.

72
00:03:32.883 --> 00:03:37.508
"But I know what I'm not getting for her—a doll!"
